Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.69,0:00:19.19,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,是辆电动车 \N{\fs50}All right, we got an EV!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.19,0:00:21.44,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,铺设两条水带\N{\fs50}Let's get two attack lines going now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.44,0:00:23.40,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,队长 火好像还没烧到电动车\N{\fs50}Looks like the fire hasn't reached the EV yet, Cap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.40,0:00:25.16,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,对 但没必要烧到 \N{\fs50}Yeah, it doesn't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.16,0:00:26.78,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,现在的温度足够把电池煮爆了\N{\fs50}The heat's enough to cook the battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.78,0:00:28.41,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,再过大概五分钟 就会发生热失控\N{\fs50}In about five minutes, we're looking at a thermal runaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.78,0:00:30.43,置顶,,0,0,0,,电池内部因热量累积 导致温度急剧升高 最终引发燃烧或爆炸的过程
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.41,0:00:30.41,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,要不要先用热成像仪\N{\fs50}Should we check the battery with the thermal imaging
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.41,0:00:33.37,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 检测一下电池情况 - 不用 先确保现场安全 \N{\fs50}- camera first? - No, first, we make things safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.37,0:00:35.25,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,听着 立刻设置警戒区域 \N{\fs50}All right? I want you to get me a perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.25,0:00:36.79,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 路锥全摆上 - 收到 队长 \N{\fs50}- Cones all around! - Copy that, Cap!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.79,0:00:39.54,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,迪亚兹 那辆车里还有其他人吗 \N{\fs50}All right, Diaz, anyone else in that car?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.54,0:00:41.17,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 确认完毕 队长 只有一个 - 好的 \N{\fs50}- All clear, Cap. Only one. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.17,0:00:44.50,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 撑住 伙计 - 给他来点氧气 \N{\fs50}- I've got you, buddy. - Let's get him on some O2.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.03,0:00:48.39,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我这里有个被困的受害者 电池还在升温 \N{\fs50}All right, I got a trapped victim and a battery cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.39,0:00:50.03,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,拉维 对电动车喷水 \N{\fs50}Ravi, get me a water curtain on that EV.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.18,0:00:52.51,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 让它降温 - 马上就来 \N{\fs50}- Keep it cool. - Coming up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.39,0:00:54.77,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 巴克 - 我在 队长 \N{\fs50}- Buck! - Right here, Cap!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.77,0:00:57.72,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,女士 这是液压剪 \N{\fs50}Ma'am, steel jaws!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.52,0:01:01.56,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我的天 \N{\fs50}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.53,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,好了 队长 我们把她弄出来了 担架 \N{\fs50}Okay. Cap, we got her. Gurney!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.53,0:01:08.95,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 各位 \N{\fs50}Okay, good work, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.95,0:01:10.05,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,把伤者抬上担架后\N{\fs50}Once we get our friend on a gurney,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.05,0:01:11.66,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我们就往后撤 \N{\fs50}we're gonna pull back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.66,0:01:13.20,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,全体队员做好防御准备 \N{\fs50}All crew set for defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.20,0:01:15.75,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,重复 全体队员做好防御准备 \N{\fs50}I repeat, all crew set for defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.75,0:01:17.32,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,准备完毕\N{\fs50}All set.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.71,0:01:20.04,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,不 \N{\fs50}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.04,0:01:21.41,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,不 \N{\fs50}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.07,0:01:29.64,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 麦迪 - 别指望我\N{\fs50}- Maddie - Don't you look to me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.64,0:01:32.34,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,来安慰你 你害死了我儿子 \N{\fs50}for comfort. You murdered my son!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.95,0:01:50.78,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你起得真早 \N{\fs50}You're up early.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.78,0:01:52.58,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你也一样 \N{\fs50}Mm. So are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.58,0:01:55.25,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我答应吉允要给她做煎饼\N{\fs50}I promised Jee I'd make her pancakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.25,0:01:56.66,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,已经做好了 \N{\fs50}Already done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.66,0:02:00.10,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,而且 我还给你们俩做了午餐 \N{\fs50}Plus, I made lunch for both you guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.10,0:02:01.83,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,还给小纳什做了点果泥 \N{\fs50}and a little purée for Baby Nash.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.83,0:02:04.10,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,昨晚没睡吗\N{\fs50}So you didn't sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.46,0:02:07.05,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,睡了 但挺后悔的 \N{\fs50}I did, and I have regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.05,0:02:09.34,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你想聊聊吗 \N{\fs50}Do you want to talk about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.34,0:02:12.11,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,这事倒还犯不着找精神科医生 \N{\fs50}Well, don't really have to call Sigmund Freud on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.34,0:02:12.11,置顶,,0,0,0,,西格蒙德·弗洛伊德 奥地利犹太裔神经学家、心理学家
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.11,0:02:13.64,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,因为新来的菜鸟做噩梦 \N{\fs50}I'm having nightmares about my new probie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.64,0:02:16.68,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,这梦到什么了 火灾还是水灾 \N{\fs50}So what was it this time? Fire or flood?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.68,0:02:20.12,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,肇事逃逸 还撞见雅典娜 不过这事\N{\fs50}Hit and run, with a side of Athena, but we really should
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.12,0:02:21.65,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 咱们得先搁一搁 - 好吧 \N{\fs50}- put a pin in that one. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.65,0:02:23.36,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,等哈里正式上岗 你说不定能睡安稳些 \N{\fs50}Maybe you'll sleep easier when Harry starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.36,0:02:24.86,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他今天第一天报到 对吧\N{\fs50}I mean, today's his first day, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.86,0:02:27.19,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你怎么看起来慌慌的 \N{\fs50}Why do you seem scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.19,0:02:29.24,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我记得你挺希望哈里来118分队的 \N{\fs50}I thought you wanted Harry in the 118.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.24,0:02:32.13,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,是啊 但现在有点后悔让他来了\N{\fs50}Yeah, I did, but now I think I'm having captain's remorse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.13,0:02:35.66,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,放心吧 你会尽全力保护好他的\N{\fs50}Hey, you are gonna keep him as safe as anyone can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.66,0:02:37.82,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,希望我能做到吧\N{\fs50}If anyone can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.38,0:02:52.64,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你们说要来吃早餐\N{\fs50}When you guys said you wanted to come over
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.64,0:02:54.93,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我还真没想到\N{\fs50}for breakfast, I wasn't expecting anything
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.93,0:02:57.02,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 居然这么隆重 - 这可是\N{\fs50}- this elaborate. - Well, you're looking at
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.02,0:02:58.16,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,为哈里准备的庆祝早餐\N{\fs50}Harry's congratulatory breakfast
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.16,0:02:59.52,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,庆祝他在118队上岗的第一天 \N{\fs50}for his first day at the 118.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.52,0:03:02.16,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 那 哈里人呢 - 问得好 \N{\fs50}- So... where's Harry? - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.16,0:03:03.94,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我一大早就起来做饭了 \N{\fs50}{\i1}I got up early to cook.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.94,0:03:07.11,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我起得更早 过来帮忙做饭 \N{\fs50}{\i1}And I got up even earlier to come over to help cook.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.11,0:03:08.78,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,结果我们俩还没起床\N{\fs50}Except he had already left before either
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.78,0:03:10.17,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他人就先走了\N{\fs50}of us had even gotten out of bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.17,0:03:14.17,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,说是要给大家留个好印象\N{\fs50}Something about making a good first impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.04,0:03:19.08,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,弄了这么多吃的 我都不知道咋办了\N{\fs50}I just didn't know what to do with all the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.08,0:03:21.71,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,哈里不在正好便宜我了\N{\fs50}Well, Harry's loss is my gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.71,0:03:23.92,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,给我一个煎饼\N{\fs50}Pass me them pancakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.92,0:03:27.25,置顶 斜体,,0,0,0,,♪ 一寸一寸 一滴一滴 ♪\N{\fs50}♪ {\i1}Measure by measure,{\i} {\i1}drop by drop{\i}♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.25,0:03:31.79,置顶 斜体,,0,0,0,,♪ 一磅一磅 我们清点存货  ♪\N{\fs50}♪ {\i1}And pound for pound,{\i} {\i1}we're taking stock...{\i}♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.18,0:03:39.97,置顶 斜体,,0,0,0,,♪ 停 停 停  ♪\N{\fs50}♪ {\i1}Stop, stop, stop...{\i}♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.21,0:03:49.98,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,队长 要来杯摩卡吗 \N{\fs50}Hey, Cap, you want a mocha?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.98,0:03:51.90,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我不喝牛奶巧克力 而且你不是应该\N{\fs50}Chocolate milk is for children. And shouldn't you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.90,0:03:53.28,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,去给消防车补充物资吗 新来的菜鸟会以为\N{\fs50}be stocking the rigs? Our new probie's gonna think
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.28,0:03:55.20,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,118分队全是懒鬼\N{\fs50}the 118 is full of slackers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.20,0:03:57.41,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,新来的菜鸟已经把消防物资补好了\N{\fs50}Probie already stocked the rig.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.41,0:03:58.58,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他已经来了 \N{\fs50}He's already here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.22,0:04:02.96,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,早上五点就来了 我们这些老菜鸟真是自愧不如 \N{\fs50}Since 5:00 a.m. Putting us ex-probies to shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.96,0:04:05.62,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 我在这儿 队长 - 不 \N{\fs50}- Right here, Cap. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.23,0:04:08.23,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我来的时候 \N{\fs50}And by the time I got in,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.42,0:04:10.23,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他已经整理完杂物\N{\fs50}he'd already completed a mess run
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.23,0:04:11.09,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,还洗了两大筐衣服 \N{\fs50}and two loads of laundry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.09,0:04:12.88,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,是吗 那这是什么 \N{\fs50}Oh, really. And what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.88,0:04:14.76,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,要点的咖啡 来点什么吗 队长 \N{\fs50}It's coffee orders. You want something, Cap?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.76,0:04:16.93,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,拉维说你喜欢街角那家 \N{\fs50}Ravi said you like that spot down the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.93,0:04:19.18,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,行 我确实想喝点 \N{\fs50}Yes. Yes, I do want something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.18,0:04:20.52,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,非常感谢 不过 \N{\fs50}Thank you very much, but, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.52,0:04:22.77,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,还是让拉维去帮我买吧 \N{\fs50}Ravi here is gonna get it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.77,0:04:25.44,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,让我去 可他才是菜鸟啊\N{\fs50}Me? Uh, but he's the probie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.44,0:04:27.48,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你想让他第一天上班就被烫伤吗 \N{\fs50}You want him scalding himself on his first day?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.48,0:04:29.11,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 不太想 - 他一绊 \N{\fs50}- Not particularly? - He trips,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.11,0:04:30.23,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,杯盖一滑 嘭的一下 \N{\fs50}the lid slips, bam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.23,0:04:31.78,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,三度烫伤 \N{\fs50}Third-degree burns,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.78,0:04:33.15,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,都赖巴克利的摩卡 \N{\fs50}all courtesy of Buckley's mocha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.15,0:04:36.53,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,所以 我得派个更有经验的人去 \N{\fs50}No, I'm sending someone with more experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.53,0:04:39.41,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,更有 买咖啡经验\N{\fs50}More experience... getting coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.41,0:04:41.29,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,队长 我在咖啡店干过 \N{\fs50}Cap, I... I worked at a coffee shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.29,0:04:44.78,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,确实 咖啡是他唯一的工作经验 \N{\fs50}Yeah, coffee is the only work experience he has.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.29,0:04:49.70,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,别担心 哈里 拉维能搞定 \N{\fs50}Don't worry about it, Harry. Ravi's got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.42,0:04:54.27,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,好了 菜鸟 第一次出警 走吧 \N{\fs50}Okay. Here we go, rookie. First call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.27,0:04:56.28,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,这就对了 我们走 \N{\fs50}That's what I'm talking about. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.01,0:04:58.59,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,要不还是算了吧\N{\fs50}Or let's stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.59,0:05:00.28,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,队长 \N{\fs50}Cap?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.28,0:05:01.64,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你今天早上够忙的了 \N{\fs50}You've had a big morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.64,0:05:04.28,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,这样吧 你留下来待命 好吗 \N{\fs50}You know what? Better that you hang back, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.28,0:05:06.29,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,那你们出勤时我该做什么 \N{\fs50}Uh, what should I do while you're gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.52,0:05:09.15,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,歇会儿 打个盹 或者看看电视\N{\fs50}Just take a break or a nap, you know? Maybe watch some TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.15,0:05:10.82,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,电视 \N{\fs50}TV?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.82,0:05:12.02,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,这班值下来挺久的 听我的 \N{\fs50}Yeah, it's a long shift. You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.02,0:05:13.89,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,得劳逸结合 \N{\fs50}You should pace yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.28,0:05:17.94,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,收到 \N{\fs50}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.95,0:05:25.50,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,里德 \N{\fs50}Reid?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.50,0:05:27.87,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 哇哦 - 里德 \N{\fs50}- Bah! - Reid?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.87,0:05:29.67,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,宝贝 快下来 你会伤到自己的 \N{\fs50}Baby, get down. You'll hurt yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.67,0:05:31.71,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,妈妈 我是超人里德 \N{\fs50}Mom, I'm SuperReid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.71,0:05:32.84,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,从不受伤 \N{\fs50}I never get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.84,0:05:35.09,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,那也会磕到的\N{\fs50}Okay, you'll get injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.09,0:05:37.05,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我能帮忙吗 \N{\fs50}Oh, can I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.05,0:05:38.32,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,小心点 \N{\fs50}Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.47,0:05:41.47,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,宝贝 你和刀子可合不来 \N{\fs50}Sweetie, you and knives don't mix.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.47,0:05:43.18,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,超人有保护罩\N{\fs50}Superman has a force field.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.18,0:05:45.64,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,但你去急诊的次数都快能办会员卡了\N{\fs50}You practically have a punch card at urgent care.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.64,0:05:47.56,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你从来不让我做有意思的事\N{\fs50}You never let me do anything fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.56,0:05:50.33,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 不准摔跤 - 那是格斗 \N{\fs50}- No wrestling. - It's sanctioned combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.33,0:05:53.11,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 不准踢足球 - 加了个球的摔跤 \N{\fs50}- No football. - Wrestling, plus a ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.11,0:05:54.90,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,不准溜冰 \N{\fs50}No roller-skating.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.90,0:05:57.57,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,谁说要溜冰了 \N{\fs50}Who said anything about roller-skating?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.57,0:05:59.16,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,兰斯的生日派对 \N{\fs50}Lance's birthday party.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.16,0:06:03.32,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他说你肯定不让我去 \N{\fs50}He said you probably won't let me come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.58,0:06:06.62,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,宝贝\N{\fs50}Baby...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.62,0:06:09.46,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你可没跟我说兰斯要办派对 \N{\fs50}you never said anything about Lance having a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.46,0:06:11.20,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,那我能去吗\N{\fs50}So I can go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.59,0:06:16.88,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,里德 妈妈最重要的职责是什么 \N{\fs50}Reid, what's my most important job?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.88,0:06:19.43,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,保护我的安全 \N{\fs50}To keep me safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.43,0:06:22.67,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,但超人可以保护自己 \N{\fs50}But Superman can keep himself safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.60,0:06:26.10,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,等你长大点 你也可以 \N{\fs50}And someday you'll be able to do that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.10,0:06:28.98,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,在那之前 咱们俩得一起 \N{\fs50}Until then, it's you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.98,0:06:30.37,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,好吗 \N{\fs50}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.37,0:06:33.11,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,就像蝙蝠侠和罗宾 \N{\fs50}Like Batman and Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.37,0:06:33.11,置顶,,0,0,0,,DC漫画中最著名的英雄搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.11,0:06:35.11,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我就知道你不让我去 \N{\fs50}I knew you'd say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.11,0:06:36.82,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我是唯一不能去的小孩 \N{\fs50}I'm the only kid not going!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.82,0:06:38.38,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你和别的孩子不一样 \N{\fs50}You're not other kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.38,0:06:40.38,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他们觉得我是个怪胎 \N{\fs50}They think I'm a freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.38,0:06:42.82,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,太危险了 \N{\fs50}It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.82,0:06:45.32,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我恨你 \N{\fs50}I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.58,0:06:50.67,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,随便你怎么恨 \N{\fs50}Hate me all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.67,0:06:52.39,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,但我是你妈妈 \N{\fs50}But I am your mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.39,0:06:54.39,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我会不惜一切代价保护你 \N{\fs50}and I will protect you no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.46,0:06:59.25,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,妈妈 \N{\fs50}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.61,0:07:17.06,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,妈妈 我没事 \N{\fs50}Mom, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.61,0:07:21.36,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,妈妈 \N{\fs50}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.36,0:07:22.98,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,妈妈 \N{\fs50}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.34,0:07:25.42,接线样式,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,115)\fs50}911接线员
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.59,0:07:25.42,接线样式,,0,0,0,,{\clip(640,280,640,334)\t(0,1248,1,\clip(640,280,1279,334))}{\pos(960,330)}这里是911 请问有什么紧急情况
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.47,0:07:26.84,接线样式,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,720)\fs50}来电人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.84,0:07:26.84,接线样式,,0,0,0,,{\clip(843,880,843,934)\t(0,500,1,\clip(843,880,1077,934))}{\pos(960,930)}救救我妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.98,0:07:25.98,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.12,0:07:30.00,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,好的 我是来帮助你的 你妈妈怎么了 \N{\fs50}Okay, I'm here to help. What's going on with your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.00,0:07:31.96,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,她一动不动 我们家着火了 \N{\fs50}She's not moving! Our house is on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.96,0:07:33.83,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,在皇后街1812号 \N{\fs50}1812 Queen Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.83,0:07:35.71,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,消防员已经在路上了 我叫麦迪 \N{\fs50}Firefighters are on their way. I'm Maddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.71,0:07:36.88,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么名字 - 里德 \N{\fs50}- What's your name? {\i1}- Reid.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.88,0:07:39.21,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,请救救我们 火太大了 \N{\fs50}Please help us. There's so much fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.21,0:07:41.22,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 火从墙里窜出来了 - 听起来像是\N{\fs50}- It's shooting out of the wall! - It sounds like{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.22,0:07:43.22,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,燃气管道泄漏 你说你妈妈一动不动 \N{\fs50}a gas line. You said your mom's not moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.22,0:07:44.44,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我觉得她撞到脑袋了 \N{\fs50}{\i1}I think she hit her head.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.44,0:07:46.05,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,她不动了 妈妈 求你了 \N{\fs50}She won't move. Mom, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.05,0:07:49.56,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,快起来啊 家里着火了 妈妈 \N{\fs50}Mom, you got to get up. The house is on fire! Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.56,0:07:51.43,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,求求你 你答应过我的 \N{\fs50}Please. You promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.43,0:07:54.45,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我们要像蝙蝠侠和罗宾一样 对吧 \N{\fs50}You and me, like Batman and Robin, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.69,0:07:56.46,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,里德 你能走到前门那里吗 \N{\fs50}Reid, do you have a path to the front door?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.65,0:07:58.46,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 能 - 我需要你出去 \N{\fs50}- Yeah. {\i1}- I need you to go.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.46,0:07:59.61,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,跑到屋外 挥动双手\N{\fs50}{\i1}Run outside, wave your arms{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.61,0:08:01.32,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,这样消防员就能看到你 \N{\fs50}so firefighters can see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.32,0:08:02.78,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我不能丢下妈妈 \N{\fs50}I'm not leaving my mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.78,0:08:04.11,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,里德 妈妈也希望你平平安安的 \N{\fs50}{\i1}Reid, she would want you{\i} {\i1}to be safe.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.11,0:08:06.07,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,快从房子里出来\N{\fs50}I need you to get out of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.07,0:08:07.40,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,不 \N{\fs50}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.91,0:08:10.83,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,那你家里有灭火器吗 \N{\fs50}Okay, do you have a fire extinguisher?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.83,0:08:13.32,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,在柜子里 \N{\fs50}In the cabinet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.92,0:08:16.49,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你找到了吗 \N{\fs50}{\i1}Did you find it?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.92,0:08:18.48,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,里德 \N{\fs50}Reid?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.48,0:08:21.59,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,麦迪 燃气灶原来的位置 有个阀门 \N{\fs50}Maddie, there's a knob here where the stove was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.59,0:08:22.48,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,那是燃气总阀 \N{\fs50}That's the gas shutoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.72,0:08:24.09,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,它着火了 \N{\fs50}It's on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.09,0:08:26.09,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,那就退后 别管它 \N{\fs50}Then step back. Leave it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.09,0:08:27.89,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,但关了它就能止住大火 对吗\N{\fs50}{\i1}But it'll stop the big fire,{\i} {\i1}right?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.89,0:08:31.39,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,里德 别碰那个阀门 很烫 \N{\fs50}{\i1}Reid, do not touch that knob!{\i} {\i1}It's red hot.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.39,0:08:32.48,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,里德\N{\fs50}Reid?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.48,0:08:34.49,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我要动手了 \N{\fs50}Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.49,0:08:36.06,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,别 别碰 里德 听我说\N{\fs50}No, no, no, don't! Reid, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.06,0:08:37.90,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,消防员马上就到了\N{\fs50}{\i1}The firefighters{\i} {\i1}are almost there.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.90,0:08:40.50,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,里德 你还在吗 \N{\fs50}{\i1}Reid, are you there?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.94,0:08:43.49,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,里德\N{\fs50}{\i1}Reid,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.49,0:08:44.95,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你没事吧 \N{\fs50}are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.95,0:08:47.28,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,成功了 \N{\fs50}It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.28,0:08:50.08,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,成功了 我没事 \N{\fs50}{\i1}It worked! I feel fine.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.08,0:08:53.08,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你为什么要把手伸进火里 \N{\fs50}Why would you stick your hand into the fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.08,0:08:54.51,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你知道那有多危险吗 \N{\fs50}Do you know how dangerous that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.51,0:08:56.25,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我知道 可是家里着火了 \N{\fs50}I guess, but the house was on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.25,0:08:58.52,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你这孩子 可真勇敢 肯定疼死了 \N{\fs50}You're tough as nails, pal. This must hurt like heck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.52,0:09:00.52,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,并不疼 \N{\fs50}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.30,0:09:03.71,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 我什么都感觉不到 - 里德不是普通孩子 \N{\fs50}- Nothing hurts me. - Reid's not your average kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.71,0:09:06.53,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他有先天性\N{\fs50}He has CIP. Congenital
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.68,0:09:08.53,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,痛觉缺失症\N{\fs50}Insensitivity to Pain. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.68,0:09:08.53,置顶,,0,0,0,,极为罕见的遗传性神经系统疾病 患者先天无法感知物理疼痛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.53,0:09:10.14,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 这很罕见 - 是的 \N{\fs50}- Wow, that's pretty rare. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.14,0:09:11.39,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我也是后来才知道的 \N{\fs50}So I've learned.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.39,0:09:12.89,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,保护他 不让他伤到自己\N{\fs50}Protecting him from himself
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.89,0:09:14.53,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,就是我的全职工作 \N{\fs50}is my full-time job.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.53,0:09:18.15,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他感觉不到疼痛 愁死人了\N{\fs50}He feels no pain, and it's a pain in the butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.15,0:09:20.90,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 今天这是超能力 - 好了 队长 \N{\fs50}- Well, today it was a superpower. - Okay, Cap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.90,0:09:22.54,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,厨房排查完毕 \N{\fs50}Kitchen's overhauled.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.54,0:09:27.11,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 你 处理得很好 干得不错 - 谢谢 \N{\fs50}- You, great work on that gas line. Good job. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.11,0:09:29.77,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 你救了你的房子 - 还有你的妈妈 \N{\fs50}- You saved your house. - Not to mention your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.91,0:09:32.54,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,好了 准备撤离 \N{\fs50}All right, let's load up and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.54,0:09:34.33,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,慢慢来 孩子 \N{\fs50}All right, nice and easy, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.33,0:09:35.91,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,好的 \N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.91,0:09:38.57,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 尽量别乱动 好吗 - 好的 \N{\fs50}- Try and keep this still, okay? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.29,0:09:42.92,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,小心点 小家伙 别被斗篷绊倒了 \N{\fs50}Careful, kiddo. Don't trip on your cape.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.92,0:09:44.91,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,妈妈 我没事 \N{\fs50}Mom, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.26,0:09:48.57,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你不可能事事都保护得了他们 \N{\fs50}Can't protect 'em from everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.35,0:10:01.06,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,这里是911 请问有什么紧急情况\N{\fs50}{\i1}911. What's your emergency?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.06,0:10:02.58,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我在五旬节圣堂祈祷会教堂 \N{\fs50}{\i1}I'm at the Church of the{\i} {\i1}Pentecostal Temple of Prayer!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.58,0:10:05.56,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,魔鬼附身了阿比盖尔姊妹 \N{\fs50}{\i1}The devil has entered{\i} {\i1}Sister Abigail.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.95,0:10:10.11,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我们正在为她驱魔 \N{\fs50}{\i1}We were exorcising{\i} {\i1}the demons from her,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.11,0:10:13.82,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,现在魔鬼又咬住了以撒弟兄 \N{\fs50}{\i1}and now, the devil's got{\i} {\i1}his teeth in Brother Isaac!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.37,0:10:20.60,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我们赶到现场时 那名年轻女孩被绑在 \N{\fs50}When we arrived, the young woman was on a table...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.04,0:10:22.60,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,一张桌子上\N{\fs50}{\i1}...in restraints.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.13,0:10:25.76,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,血压和心率\N{\fs50}Her blood pressure and heart rate
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.76,0:10:27.97,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,都很高 而且身体\N{\fs50}were elevated, and her body was
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.97,0:10:29.51,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,剧烈抽搐\N{\fs50}{\i1}spasming severely.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.51,0:10:31.26,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,但你们接到的求助电话\N{\fs50}But the call you were responding to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.26,0:10:32.61,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,并没有提到这些情况 \N{\fs50}didn't mention any of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.80,0:10:35.22,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,报警人只说她咬伤了牧师 \N{\fs50}We were told she had bitten the minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.22,0:10:38.10,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,但我们到了现场才意识到\N{\fs50}But when we got there, we realized
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.10,0:10:40.30,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,事情远不止如此 \N{\fs50}there was something else going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.02,0:10:44.62,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,是什么导致一个十七岁的女孩\N{\fs50}What would cause a 17-year-old girl
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.62,0:10:46.63,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,去咬一个成年男人 \N{\fs50}to bite a grown man?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.63,0:10:48.15,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,破伤风 \N{\fs50}It was tetanus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.63,0:10:53.51,置顶,,0,0,0,,由破伤风梭菌引起的严重急性神经系统感染疾病\N会导致肌肉强直性抽搐和呼吸困难
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.15,0:10:50.63,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,也就是下颌僵硬症 是一种\N{\fs50}{\i1}Lockjaw. A bacterial
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.82,0:10:53.49,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,细菌性感染 通常由穿刺伤引发 \N{\fs50}infection usually caused by some kind of puncture wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.49,0:10:55.45,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,阿比盖尔是怎么受这种伤的 \N{\fs50}How did Abigail get such a wound?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.45,0:10:58.20,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,她 住的那个房间 \N{\fs50}The room she was... staying in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.20,0:10:59.50,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,有一张老旧的金属床架\N{\fs50}{\i1}There was an old,{\i} {\i1}metal bed frame.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.50,0:11:01.67,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,床尾的栏杆断了 \N{\fs50}{\i1}The footboard was broken.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.67,0:11:03.38,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,如果她的破伤风\N{\fs50}What was the likely outcome
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.38,0:11:05.50,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,没有得到治疗 结果会怎样 \N{\fs50}if her tetanus had remained untreated?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.50,0:11:07.80,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,呼吸困难 肺炎 \N{\fs50}Trouble breathing, pneumonia,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.80,0:11:10.63,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,抽搐导致的骨折 \N{\fs50}broken bones from the spasms
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.63,0:11:12.65,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,甚至可能死亡 \N{\fs50}and possibly death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.65,0:11:15.72,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 威尔逊消防员 \N{\fs50}Thank you, Firefighter Wilson.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.72,0:11:19.10,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你有十五年的医护经验 \N{\fs50}You have 15 years of experience as a medic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.10,0:11:20.18,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,对吗 \N{\fs50}Is that correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.18,0:11:21.89,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,是的 \N{\fs50}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.89,0:11:25.15,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,和你当父母的经验相比 是多还是少 \N{\fs50}Is that more or less experience than you've had as a parent?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.15,0:11:26.67,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,当父母更多是凭直觉 \N{\fs50}I parent with my gut.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.82,0:11:28.67,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,成功远多于失败 \N{\fs50}I succeed more than I fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.86,0:11:31.36,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我有时是否对孩子保护过度 当然 \N{\fs50}Do I keep my son too close from time to time? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.36,0:11:33.57,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,但我有没有把他绑在桌子上 \N{\fs50}But do I tie him up to a table?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.57,0:11:35.66,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,有没有把他锁在小房间里 \N{\fs50}Do I lock him in a cell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.66,0:11:36.68,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,绝对不会\N{\fs50}Hell no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.83,0:11:39.54,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你是不是个很容易愤怒的人 \N{\fs50}Aren't you a very angry man,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.54,0:11:41.66,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,迪亚兹消防员 \N{\fs50}Firefighter Diaz?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.21,0:11:43.58,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,曾经是 \N{\fs50}I used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.58,0:11:46.09,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你不是曾因一个\N{\fs50}Weren't you cited
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.09,0:11:49.71,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,让我看看 停车位问题 \N{\fs50}for assaulting a man over let's see here
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.71,0:11:51.63,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,而被指控袭击他人 \N{\fs50}a parking spot?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.63,0:11:53.84,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 那是因为 - 这正能说明\N{\fs50}- That was - Emblematic of the violent temper
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.84,0:11:56.68,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你对我当事人施加的暴力行为 \N{\fs50}you exercised against my clients while on the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.68,0:11:58.70,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 我没有施暴 - 你的言语粗暴 \N{\fs50}- I was not violent. - Verbally abusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.70,0:12:00.68,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,造成了不必要的精神伤害 \N{\fs50}Causing undue emotional distress.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.68,0:12:02.23,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,彻头彻尾的恐吓 \N{\fs50}Downright intimidation!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.23,0:12:04.06,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,这根本不是事实 \N{\fs50}That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.06,0:12:08.15,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,也正因如此 这影响了他们随后\N{\fs50}That is what colored any subsequent statements
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.15,0:12:10.18,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,向警方做的所有陈述 \N{\fs50}from them to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.57,0:12:16.72,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我们以后能别\N{\fs50}Can we please never
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.72,0:12:17.95,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 再经历这种事了 - 借你吉言 \N{\fs50}- do that again? - From your lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.83,0:12:23.41,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,阿比盖尔 \N{\fs50}Abigail.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.41,0:12:25.42,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 \N{\fs50}It's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.42,0:12:28.09,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我一直没机会向你道谢 \N{\fs50}I never got the chance to say thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.09,0:12:29.92,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我想你当时有很多事要处理 \N{\fs50}I think you had a lot going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.92,0:12:32.73,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你能好起来 我们就很开心了 \N{\fs50}And we're just happy you're back on your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.59,0:12:34.73,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 威尔逊消防员 \N{\fs50}- Yeah. - Firefighter Wilson,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.73,0:12:36.51,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,借一步说话 \N{\fs50}can I borrow you for a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.51,0:12:38.74,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,保重 \N{\fs50}Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.74,0:12:41.26,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,谢谢 \N{\fs50}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.18,0:12:45.44,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,阿比盖尔 你今天表现得特别棒 \N{\fs50}Hey, you did a great job today, Abigail.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.44,0:12:48.75,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,敢于反抗他们 非常勇敢 \N{\fs50}Uh, standing up to them is incredibly brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.75,0:12:49.69,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你是怎么做到的 \N{\fs50}How did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.69,0:12:51.28,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,做到 \N{\fs50}Do...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.28,0:12:52.75,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,什么 \N{\fs50}what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.94,0:12:56.44,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,不那么 愤怒 \N{\fs50}Learn to be less... angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.28,0:13:01.11,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,靠时间 \N{\fs50}Time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.74,0:13:03.32,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,靠心理治疗 \N{\fs50}Therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.87,0:13:05.79,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,一次又一次的治疗 \N{\fs50}More therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.79,0:13:07.71,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,家人朋友的陪伴也很重要 \N{\fs50}Having friends and family helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.71,0:13:10.77,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,有人一直拉着我别走偏 帮了很大忙 \N{\fs50}You know, keeping me on the right path helped a lot, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.13,0:13:17.59,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,至少我还有时间\N{\fs50}Well, at least I've got the time part.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.59,0:13:19.47,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,至于别的 \N{\fs50}The rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.47,0:13:22.47,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我连油钱都快付不起了 更别说做心理治疗了 \N{\fs50}Can't really afford therapy when I can barely afford gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.47,0:13:24.23,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我记得你之前在寄养体系里 \N{\fs50}Thought you were in the foster care system.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.23,0:13:26.52,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 他们没有提供援助吗 - 我满十八岁了 \N{\fs50}- Don't they have resources? - I turned 18.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.52,0:13:28.31,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,寄养中心给了我一张生日贺卡\N{\fs50}Foster care gave me a birthday card
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.31,0:13:31.15,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,还有一张去外婆家的公交车票 \N{\fs50}and a bus ticket to my grandmother's.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.15,0:13:34.15,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,外婆把车丢给我 让我自己走人\N{\fs50}She gave me her car to get rid of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.15,0:13:36.14,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我就一直睡在车里 \N{\fs50}I've been sleeping in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.78,0:13:39.62,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,这就是被解救后的小小代价\N{\fs50}That's the small downside to being rescued.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.62,0:13:43.28,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,当然 再也没人会伤害你了 但 \N{\fs50}There is no one left to hurt you, sure, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.87,0:13:46.28,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,这也意味着 真的一个人都没有了\N{\fs50}...that's because there's nobody left at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.38,0:13:51.79,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,总会有人在乎你的 \N{\fs50}Well, there are people who care about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.38,0:13:55.41,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,在哪呢\N{\fs50}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.31,0:14:08.06,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 怎么样 - 这个嘛 非常复杂 \N{\fs50}- How was it? - It was, uh, very complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.06,0:14:09.40,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,相当棘手 \N{\fs50}Touch and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.40,0:14:11.15,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,两个孩子的牙套缠在一起了 \N{\fs50}Two kids had their braces stuck together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.15,0:14:13.77,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,埃迪回来了吗 \N{\fs50}Hey, did Eddie make it back yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.77,0:14:16.84,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,是的 他还带了个朋友回来 \N{\fs50}Uh, yeah, yeah, and he brought a friend with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.84,0:14:18.20,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,嗨 各位 \N{\fs50}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.20,0:14:19.61,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你们还记得阿比盖尔吧 \N{\fs50}You remember Abigail.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.61,0:14:20.84,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,当然 \N{\fs50}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.99,0:14:22.37,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我倒希望我也记得你们 \N{\fs50}I wish I could say the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.37,0:14:24.33,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,那天我唯一记得的就是\N{\fs50}The only thing I remember from that day is
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.33,0:14:26.40,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,埃迪的脸 \N{\fs50}Eddie's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.00,0:14:30.58,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,这位是韩队长 这位是巴克 那位是拉维 \N{\fs50}Oh, this is Captain Han, that's Buck, and that's Ravi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.58,0:14:32.85,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,真的不知道该怎么感谢你们 \N{\fs50}I can't tell you how much I appreciate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.85,0:14:34.85,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你已经救过我一次了 \N{\fs50}You've already saved my life once.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.09,0:14:37.17,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,现在感觉你又救了我一次 \N{\fs50}Now I feel like you're saving it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.17,0:14:39.17,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,这是我们的职责 埃迪 能跟你说句话吗 \N{\fs50}Well, it's what we do. Eddie, can I get a word?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.17,0:14:40.86,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我得跟你聊聊那件事 \N{\fs50}I need to talk to you about that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.86,0:14:43.55,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 失陪一下 - 当然 队长 \N{\fs50}- Pardon us. - Sure, Cap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.06,0:14:47.88,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他有麻烦了吗 \N{\fs50}Is he in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.52,0:14:50.19,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,有麻烦 \N{\fs50}Uh, trouble, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.19,0:14:51.69,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,不 没有 \N{\fs50}No, he-he's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.69,0:14:55.40,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我不希望他有麻烦 他对我特别好 \N{\fs50}I'd hate for him to be. He's been so kind to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.40,0:14:58.88,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他看我无家可归 就把我带到这儿了 \N{\fs50}He saw I didn't have any place to go, so he brought me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.11,0:15:02.06,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,平时都是巴克把流浪的小动物带回来 \N{\fs50}It's usually Buck who brings in the strays.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.61,0:15:04.87,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我不是说你是流浪的小动物 \N{\fs50}Not that you're a stray.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.87,0:15:08.65,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,不 我就是 \N{\fs50}No. That's exactly what I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.96,0:15:13.33,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,这辈子 我身边就只有爸妈 \N{\fs50}My whole life, it was just me and my mom and my dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.33,0:15:15.29,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,可现在\N{\fs50}and...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.29,0:15:16.90,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,一个都没了 \N{\fs50}now there's nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.90,0:15:19.88,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,阿比盖尔 总会有人陪着你的\N{\fs50}Hey, there's always somebody, Abigail.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.88,0:15:23.47,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,家人并不仅只是血缘上的亲人 \N{\fs50}Family isn't just the people you're born to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.47,0:15:26.25,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,也是那些你主动选择的人 \N{\fs50}It's also the people you choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.44,0:15:32.91,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,她现在无依无靠\N{\fs50}She's got nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.91,0:15:34.93,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,她需要帮助 \N{\fs50}She needs help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.81,0:15:37.65,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我只是担心 她需要的那种帮助 \N{\fs50}I'm just afraid the kind of help she needs,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.65,0:15:38.92,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,在这里我们给不了 \N{\fs50}we can't give it to her here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.07,0:15:42.52,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,所以我才叫了后援 \N{\fs50}Which is why I brought backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.62,0:15:46.93,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,艾丽克斯 \N{\fs50}Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.93,0:15:48.29,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,迪亚兹消防员 \N{\fs50}Firefighter Diaz.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.29,0:15:50.53,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,那是谁 \N{\fs50}Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.46,0:15:52.93,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,她是艾丽克斯 \N{\fs50}That's Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.67,0:15:56.94,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,阿比盖尔 这位是艾丽克斯·道尔 \N{\fs50}Abigail, this is Alex Doyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.94,0:16:00.01,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,洛杉矶警局SMART项目的成员 全称是 \N{\fs50}She's part of LAPD's SMART program, which stands for
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.01,0:16:03.93,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 系统性 - 全市心理评估应对小组 \N{\fs50}- Systematic... - Systemwide Mental Assessment Response Team.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.93,0:16:06.26,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 你觉得我精神有问题 \N{\fs50}- Yeah. - You think I'm mental?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.26,0:16:07.93,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我知道你经历了很多 \N{\fs50}I think you've been through a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.93,0:16:10.02,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我的工作之一 就是帮助人们\N{\fs50}And part of my job is to connect people
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.02,0:16:12.95,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,联系到他们需要的资源 让他们能重新好好生活 \N{\fs50}to the resources they need to get them back on their feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.19,0:16:16.52,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我听说\N{\fs50}I, um... I understand
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.52,0:16:19.68,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你最近无家可归 \N{\fs50}that you've been dealing with some homelessness?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.69,0:16:24.20,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我一直住在我外婆的车里 \N{\fs50}I've been living in my grandmother's car.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.20,0:16:27.32,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,艾丽克斯会帮你找个地方住 \N{\fs50}Alex is going to help you find a place to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.32,0:16:30.65,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,其实 我已经找好了 \N{\fs50}Actually, I... I already did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.20,0:16:32.97,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,真的 \N{\fs50}You did?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.97,0:16:34.42,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,在哪 \N{\fs50}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.42,0:16:37.92,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,帕萨迪纳那边的过渡性住房 \N{\fs50}Faith-based transitional housing in Pasadena.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.92,0:16:42.30,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,那里有心理咨询服务 还有大学预科辅导 \N{\fs50}They have, uh, counseling and college prep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.30,0:16:45.96,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你可以先住一晚 要是觉得好 也可以多住些日子 \N{\fs50}You can stay the night, or longer if you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.59,0:16:47.93,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样 阿比盖尔 \N{\fs50}What do you say, Abigail?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.93,0:16:50.60,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我不知道 \N{\fs50}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.60,0:16:53.39,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我们可以顺路给你买点洗漱用品 \N{\fs50}We can stop and-and get you some toiletries.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.39,0:16:55.52,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,再买几双新袜子 \N{\fs50}Maybe some fresh socks?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.52,0:16:58.01,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我不需要袜子 \N{\fs50}I don't need socks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.99,0:17:09.28,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,就让这位好心的女士给你买几双 \N{\fs50}Uh, why don't you let the nice lady buy you some socks?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.28,0:17:11.40,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,好不好 \N{\fs50}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.17,0:17:19.02,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 好的 \N{\fs50}- Okay. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.98,0:17:25.07,接线样式,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,115)\fs50}911接线员
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.23,0:17:25.07,接线样式,,0,0,0,,{\clip(640,280,640,334)\t(0,1248,1,\clip(640,280,1279,334))}{\pos(960,330)}这里是911 请问有什么紧急情况
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.11,0:17:26.48,接线样式,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,720)\fs50}来电人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.40,0:17:26.48,接线样式,,0,0,0,,{\clip(820,880,820,934)\t(0,540,1,\clip(820,880,1099,934))}{\pos(960,930)}我爸爸失踪了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.72,0:17:26.72,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.72,0:17:28.22,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,先生 我叫麦迪 \N{\fs50}Okay, sir, my name's Maddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.22,0:17:29.64,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我需要了解一些信息 \N{\fs50}I'm gonna need some information.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.64,0:17:31.43,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我是安德鲁 我爸爸叫比尔 \N{\fs50}{\i1}I'm Andrew.{\i} {\i1}My dad's name is Bill.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.43,0:17:33.03,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,全名叫威廉·施耐德 \N{\fs50}Uh, uh, William Schneider.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.03,0:17:34.60,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他八十七岁了 \N{\fs50}He's, uh, 87.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.60,0:17:38.52,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,身高一米九二 白色头发 绿色眼睛 \N{\fs50}{\i1}Uh, six-four,{\i} {\i1}white hair, green eyes.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.52,0:17:40.36,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他肯定是自己走丢的 \N{\fs50}He must have just wandered off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.36,0:17:43.04,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我觉得他自己都不知道要去哪 \N{\fs50}Uh, I mean, I don't even think he knows where he's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.04,0:17:45.04,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你觉得他可能是迷路了 \N{\fs50}You think he might have gotten lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.04,0:17:47.03,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他肯定是搞糊涂了 \N{\fs50}{\i1}He must have gotten confused.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.03,0:17:49.95,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我真应该盯紧点他的 \N{\fs50}Ah, I should have been watching him closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.95,0:17:51.05,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他最后出现的位置是哪里 \N{\fs50}What was his last known location?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.28,0:17:54.37,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他家 切斯特街104号 \N{\fs50}{\i1}Uh, his house,{\i} {\i1}104 Chester Street.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.37,0:17:56.33,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我现在就在他家\N{\fs50}Uh, I'm-I'm here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.33,0:18:00.02,置顶,,0,0,0,,公共紧急寻人预警机制 主要用于寻找走失的老年人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.33,0:17:59.33,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,所有单位注意 发布银色警报 寻找威廉·施耐德 \N{\fs50}All units, starting a Silver Alert for William Schneider.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.33,0:18:03.06,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,目标可能意识不清 先生 请留在你父亲家里 好吗 \N{\fs50}May be disoriented. Sir, don't leave your dad's house, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.06,0:18:05.38,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我们派了最优秀的人员去找他 \N{\fs50}We have the best people working to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.38,0:18:07.07,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,安德鲁·施耐德 \N{\fs50}Andrew Schneider?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.30,0:18:08.51,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你来得真快 \N{\fs50}You got here fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.51,0:18:10.25,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,请进 \N{\fs50}Please come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.84,0:18:13.39,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,还是没收到你父亲的消息吗 \N{\fs50}Uh, so, still no word from your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.39,0:18:16.18,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,没有 我梳理了一下时间线 \N{\fs50}No. I worked up a timeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.18,0:18:19.08,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,昨天下午六点 我还跟他通了电话 跟往常一样 \N{\fs50}I spoke to him yesterday at 6:00 p.m. like we always do,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.08,0:18:22.52,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,今早的监控里 最后看到他是\N{\fs50}and then, uh, this morning, I have him on the cameras
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.52,0:18:25.08,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,上午的11点56分 \N{\fs50}up until, uh, 11:56 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.08,0:18:26.44,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你 呃 \N{\fs50}Oh, you, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.44,0:18:28.82,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,真是把他看得死死的\N{\fs50}really keep an eye on him, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.82,0:18:30.11,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,没办法 我必须得这么做 \N{\fs50}Yeah, well, I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.11,0:18:31.95,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他死活不肯去养老院 \N{\fs50}I mean, he refuses to go into assisted living.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.95,0:18:34.79,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 手机还总忘充电 - 好的 \N{\fs50}- And he never remembers to charge his phone. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.79,0:18:39.10,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,那监控显示到上午11点56分之前 他在做什么 \N{\fs50}So what was he doing on the cameras up until 11:56?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.25,0:18:41.10,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,上午 就是\N{\fs50}A.m. Yes. Uh, just
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.10,0:18:42.67,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,到处瞎转悠 \N{\fs50}puttering around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.67,0:18:46.17,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,坐在电脑前玩纸牌游戏 \N{\fs50}I mean, uh, playing solitaire on his desktop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.17,0:18:48.67,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 就是平常那些事 - 嗯 \N{\fs50}- I mean, just the usual. - Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.84,0:18:55.47,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,然后 监控突然断线了 \N{\fs50}And then, the-the cameras, they just cut out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.47,0:18:57.85,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我收到监控的断线提醒 \N{\fs50}I got a notification when they went down,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.85,0:18:59.12,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,立马给他打电话 \N{\fs50}and so I tried to call him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.31,0:19:02.19,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他一直没接 我就赶紧开车过来了 \N{\fs50}He never picked up, and then I just got in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.19,0:19:03.61,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他有手机吗 \N{\fs50}Does he have a cell phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.61,0:19:05.12,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,是个翻盖手机 \N{\fs50}It's a flip phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:07.73,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,应用程序对他来说太麻烦了 \N{\fs50}I mean, apps are just asking for trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.73,0:19:12.07,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我到这儿的时候 发现他的手机放在桌子上 \N{\fs50}When I got here, I found his phone on his desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.07,0:19:14.37,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,当然是没电了 \N{\fs50}Dead, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.37,0:19:17.70,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,还有这个 \N{\fs50}Oh, uh, and, uh, this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.70,0:19:19.41,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他的紧急呼救器 \N{\fs50}Oh, his Life Alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.41,0:19:22.87,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你有没有理由怀疑是有人作案 \N{\fs50}Well, do you have any reason to suspect foul play?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.87,0:19:26.25,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,没有 我爸是个退休的数学老师 \N{\fs50}No. I mean, Dad's a retired math teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.25,0:19:29.15,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他不开车 也几乎不出门 \N{\fs50}I mean, he doesn't drive, he barely leaves the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.55,0:19:33.15,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你介意我四处看看吗 \N{\fs50}Well, uh, do you mind if I have a look around?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.15,0:19:35.15,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,不介意 请便 \N{\fs50}Uh, no. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.23,0:19:48.36,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他什么东西都会打印出来 \N{\fs50}Uh, he, uh, he prints everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.36,0:19:50.69,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,邮件 文章 我觉得 \N{\fs50}Emails, articles. I think, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.69,0:19:53.17,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,把东西打印出来能帮他记住事情 \N{\fs50}having hard copies helps him remember things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.16,0:19:57.18,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,谢丽尔·沙利文是谁 \N{\fs50}Who's Cheryl Sullivan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.33,0:19:59.57,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我不知道 \N{\fs50}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.20,0:20:02.54,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,这是什么 是机票吗 \N{\fs50}What is that? Is that a plane ticket?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.54,0:20:05.18,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,是收据 六百美元 \N{\fs50}Receipt. $600.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.38,0:20:06.75,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,还升了头等舱 \N{\fs50}Upgraded to first class.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.75,0:20:08.59,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,这太不对劲了 \N{\fs50}No, this doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.59,0:20:10.21,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他根本不认识这个女人 \N{\fs50}He doesn't know who this woman is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.21,0:20:12.34,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,她的航班一小时后就降落了 \N{\fs50}Her flight lands in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.34,0:20:14.67,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他肯定是疯了 \N{\fs50}He has lost his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.93,0:20:18.89,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,这就是你家摄像头断线的原因 \N{\fs50}Here's why your cameras went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.89,0:20:20.14,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他把插头拔了 \N{\fs50}He unplugged it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.14,0:20:22.43,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我都不知道他还认识路由器 \N{\fs50}I didn't even know he knew what a router was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.43,0:20:24.27,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你说过你父亲不开车 \N{\fs50}You said that your father doesn't drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.27,0:20:25.90,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,那他有车吗 \N{\fs50}But does he own a car?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.90,0:20:27.21,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我几个月前就把他车的钥匙拿走了 \N{\fs50}I took his keys away months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.21,0:20:29.81,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,那辆车现在在哪儿 \N{\fs50}Where is that car now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.21,0:20:33.69,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,谢天谢地 还在这儿 \N{\fs50}Oh, thank God. It's still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.59,0:20:51.23,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,这里平常停的是什么车 \N{\fs50}What's usually parked here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.89,0:21:04.93,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,先生 请靠边停车 \N{\fs50}Sir, pull your vehicle to the curb.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.85,0:21:08.81,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,比尔 洛杉矶警察 \N{\fs50}Bill? LAPD.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.81,0:21:11.65,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我们一直在找你 \N{\fs50}We've been looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.65,0:21:13.99,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我不聋 \N{\fs50}I'm not deaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.99,0:21:16.40,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,就是不想理你 \N{\fs50}I'm ignoring you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.38,0:21:30.63,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,肯定是我儿子让你们来的吧\N{\fs50}I assume my boy sent you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.63,0:21:32.09,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,是的 先生 \N{\fs50}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.09,0:21:34.63,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我是格兰特警长 \N{\fs50}My name's Sergeant Grant.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.63,0:21:37.68,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,比尔 你知道自己现在在哪吗 \N{\fs50}Bill, do you know where you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.68,0:21:42.18,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,离洛杉矶机场直线距离大概五英里 \N{\fs50}Mm, about five miles from LAX as the crow flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.18,0:21:45.56,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,那你知道自己在开什么吗 \N{\fs50}And do you know what you're driving?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.56,0:21:47.02,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,知道 \N{\fs50}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.02,0:21:50.06,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我还知道我出发时加了六夸脱的油 \N{\fs50}And I also know that I started with six quarts of gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.06,0:21:53.29,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,所以 只要你别再拦着我 \N{\fs50}So that, unless you continue to waylay me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.29,0:21:57.28,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,那我还能顺路去林肯大街的花店买束花 \N{\fs50}I should have enough to pop by the florist on Lincoln
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.28,0:21:59.30,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,然后再去见我的女性朋友 \N{\fs50}before I meet my lady friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.30,0:22:00.82,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,比尔\N{\fs50}Bill...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.82,0:22:02.91,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你离家很远了 \N{\fs50}you're a long way from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.91,0:22:05.30,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,要的就是这效果 \N{\fs50}Yeah, that's the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.30,0:22:07.66,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你干嘛把我当成失踪人口一样问话\N{\fs50}Why are you talking to me like I'm on a milk carton?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.66,0:22:09.04,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你儿子 他觉得\N{\fs50}Your son he implied
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.04,0:22:11.08,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我老糊涂了 \N{\fs50}That I've lost my marbles?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.08,0:22:13.09,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你看我像糊涂的样子吗 \N{\fs50}Well, you can see that I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.09,0:22:17.32,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,不如行个方便让我过去 \N{\fs50}So how about you just let me pass along?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.32,0:22:19.84,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,比尔 我们都清楚 这东西根本不能上路 \N{\fs50}Bill, we both know that thing's not street legal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.84,0:22:21.68,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,但它开起来感觉真不赖 \N{\fs50}But it edges like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.68,0:22:23.85,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,比尔 你可能神志清醒 \N{\fs50}Bill, you may be in your right mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.85,0:22:27.77,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,但你儿子快为你担心死了 \N{\fs50}but your son is losing his worrying about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.77,0:22:30.69,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 他把我当小孩一样对待 \N{\fs50}You know, he treats me like a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.69,0:22:33.33,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他只是希望自己的父亲能平平安安 \N{\fs50}All he wants is for his father to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.33,0:22:35.11,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我不能强迫你回家 \N{\fs50}Now, I can't force you to go home,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.11,0:22:39.34,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,但我会扣押你的割草机 \N{\fs50}but I will impound your lawn mower.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.34,0:22:41.34,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,行 \N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.12,0:22:44.53,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 拷我吧 - 呃\N{\fs50}- Cuff me. - Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.53,0:22:47.03,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你没有被逮捕 比尔 \N{\fs50}You're not under arrest, Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.37,0:22:51.35,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,但你还是要带我回监狱 \N{\fs50}But you're still taking me to prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.05,0:22:57.84,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你在想什么 \N{\fs50}What were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.84,0:23:01.64,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,为什么要开割草机去机场兜风 \N{\fs50}Why would you joyride to the airport on a lawn mower?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.64,0:23:03.36,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你拿走了我的车钥匙 \N{\fs50}You took my car keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.36,0:23:06.31,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 因为你把车撞坏了 - 是某个笨蛋\N{\fs50}- Because you wrecked the car. - Some knucklehead
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.31,0:23:09.37,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,用购物车撞了我的车 \N{\fs50}banged me with a grocery cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.60,0:23:13.37,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,警官 法律上这责任怎么算 \N{\fs50}Sergeant, where does the law stand on liability there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.37,0:23:15.37,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我不对购物车发表评论 \N{\fs50}I don't comment on carts.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.37,0:23:17.38,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,谢谢你送他回家 \N{\fs50}Thank you for bringing him home.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.38,0:23:18.94,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我得和我爸再谈谈\N{\fs50}Dad and I are gonna have another talk
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.94,0:23:20.15,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,去养老院的事 \N{\fs50}about assisted living.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.15,0:23:22.41,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我不需要人照顾 我是个成年人 \N{\fs50}I don't need assistance. I'm a grown man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.41,0:23:25.08,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,把我关到那里也阻止不了我死亡 儿子 \N{\fs50}Putting me there is not gonna stop me from dying, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.08,0:23:26.74,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,那儿就是等死的地方 \N{\fs50}People go there to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.74,0:23:28.12,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,天哪 你遇上杀猪盘了 \N{\fs50}For God's sake, you were catfished.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.12,0:23:30.21,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他在胡说八道什么 \N{\fs50}What the hell is he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.21,0:23:32.62,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,网恋诈骗 \N{\fs50}It's a romance scam.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.62,0:23:36.00,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,在网上伪装身份骗人 \N{\fs50}Uh, people online pretending to be someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.00,0:23:38.71,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,谢丽尔才不是骗子 \N{\fs50}Cheryl is not a scammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.71,0:23:40.51,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,是吗 \N{\fs50}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.51,0:23:42.59,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你给她转了六百美元 爸\N{\fs50}You sent her $600, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.59,0:23:44.97,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,她值得坐头等舱 \N{\fs50}She deserves to fly first-class.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.97,0:23:49.05,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你真觉得她会为了你 跨越大半个国家飞来\N{\fs50}Y-You really think that she flew across the country for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.14,0:23:52.22,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我觉得 \N{\fs50}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.57,0:24:01.40,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,比尔 \N{\fs50}Bill?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.40,0:24:02.57,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,比尔\N{\fs50}Bill...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.57,0:24:04.24,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,谢丽尔\N{\fs50}Cheryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.83,0:24:10.04,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你找到她了 \N{\fs50}You found her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.04,0:24:13.21,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,在到达厅外面等着呢 \N{\fs50}Waiting outside arrivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.21,0:24:16.71,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我可没想到 来接我的会是警车 \N{\fs50}Well, I wasn't expecting to be picked up in a police car.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.71,0:24:20.01,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,相信我 这已经算好的了\N{\fs50}Trust me, it could have been worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.01,0:24:22.13,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 你是真人 - 本人比网上\N{\fs50}- You're real? - And even more
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.13,0:24:26.42,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 更漂亮 - 嘴可真甜 \N{\fs50}- lovely in person. - Oh, such a charmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.45,0:24:28.97,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你们俩是怎么认识的 \N{\fs50}How did you guys meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.22,0:24:33.09,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,网络 你有空也该试试 \N{\fs50}The Internet. You ought to try it sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.45,0:24:35.85,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,警官们 非常感谢你们\N{\fs50}Uh, Officers? Thank you so much
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.85,0:24:38.82,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,把事情都处理得这么妥当 \N{\fs50}for everything you've done to square things away here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.82,0:24:40.69,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,也替我儿子跟你们道个歉 \N{\fs50}And I apologize for my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.69,0:24:42.78,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,不用道歉 \N{\fs50}No apology needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.78,0:24:46.49,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你有个非常关心你的儿子 \N{\fs50}You have a son who really cares about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.49,0:24:48.66,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你知道我只是关心你 对吧 爸 \N{\fs50}You know that's all it is, Dad, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.66,0:24:50.49,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,好吧 如果你真的关心我 \N{\fs50}Well, if you care,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.49,0:24:53.47,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,明天就去警局把我的割草机弄出来 \N{\fs50}tomorrow, get my lawn mower out of police impound.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.67,0:24:57.79,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,还有 要是不想留一辈子心理阴影 \N{\fs50}And unless you want to be scarred for life,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.79,0:25:01.83,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,今晚就别再打开那些摄像头了 \N{\fs50}don't even think about turning those cameras back on tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.76,0:25:08.34,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,总要有长大的一天 \N{\fs50}they got to grow up sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.57,0:25:24.36,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,各位 再见 \N{\fs50}Bye, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.36,0:25:25.50,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 很快会再见的 \N{\fs50}- See you. - We'll see you soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.50,0:25:26.66,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,好吗 \N{\fs50}okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.66,0:25:28.57,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我走之前 还有什么需要帮忙的吗 \N{\fs50}Unless you need anything before I leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.57,0:25:31.51,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,没有了 回家好好休息吧 \N{\fs50}Nah. Go home, get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.70,0:25:35.20,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我感觉已经休息得很好了 但还是谢谢你 \N{\fs50}I'm feeling pretty rested, but thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.59,0:25:42.17,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,可怜的孩子 \N{\fs50}Poor kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.17,0:25:44.92,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,可怜 我们擦消防车的时候 \N{\fs50}Poor kid? We're scrubbing the rigs
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.92,0:25:46.30,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 他窝在沙发上歇着 - 嘿 \N{\fs50}- and he's sitting on the couch. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.30,0:25:47.53,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他看起来并不享受 \N{\fs50}It's not like he's enjoying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.68,0:25:48.84,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,愁眉苦脸的 \N{\fs50}He looks miserable.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.84,0:25:50.76,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,换作是我 估计也开心不起来 \N{\fs50}I guess I'd be miserable, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.76,0:25:52.22,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,学校的尖子生来坐冷板凳 \N{\fs50}Academy superstar to benchwarmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.22,0:25:55.18,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,为什么奇米要用泡泡纸把他包起来 \N{\fs50}Why do we think Chim's got him in Bubble Wrap?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.18,0:25:57.89,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,可能只是想让他慢慢适应工作 \N{\fs50}He's probably just trying to ease him into the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.89,0:25:59.54,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,先安排些轻松的活 \N{\fs50}Put him on light duty for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.54,0:26:02.02,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,这活再轻松点 他都要飘走了 \N{\fs50}If he was on any lighter duty, he'd float away.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.02,0:26:04.69,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,得有人和奇米谈谈 \N{\fs50}Yeah, someone needs to talk to Chim.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.69,0:26:07.55,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,好主意 \N{\fs50}Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.82,0:26:13.20,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,不要 我再也不干这事了 \N{\fs50}No. No, I am not doing this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.20,0:26:15.91,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我可不是我姐夫的监护人 \N{\fs50}I am not my brother-in-law's keeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.91,0:26:17.56,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,可总得有人去说啊 \N{\fs50}Well, somebody needs to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.56,0:26:22.16,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我知道该找谁了 \N{\fs50}I think I know who.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.96,0:26:26.42,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,她来了 \N{\fs50}There she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.42,0:26:28.62,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我们得谈谈 \N{\fs50}We gotta talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.57,0:26:31.96,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我就怕这个 \N{\fs50}I was afraid of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.60,0:26:34.35,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,这酒不错 \N{\fs50}Nice bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.81,0:26:37.58,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我在哪看到过 说它效果好\N{\fs50}I read somewhere that it's good
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.58,0:26:39.58,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,应对突发状况 \N{\fs50}for, uh, flare-ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.90,0:26:42.11,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fs50}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.11,0:26:43.31,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,谁又抱怨了 \N{\fs50}Who complained?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.31,0:26:44.73,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,谁没抱怨 \N{\fs50}Who didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.73,0:26:46.23,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,大家都挺担心的\N{\fs50}Everyone's concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.23,0:26:47.59,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,担心我对那孩子太严厉了 \N{\fs50}What, that I'm too hard on the kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.59,0:26:50.36,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,担心你在步我们老队长的后尘 \N{\fs50}That you're following in footsteps of our old captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.36,0:26:51.95,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,巴比可不是那么好超越的 \N{\fs50}Bobby is a tough act to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.95,0:26:53.91,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,不是巴比 \N{\fs50}Not Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.91,0:26:55.12,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,是杰拉德 \N{\fs50}Captain Gerrard.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.12,0:26:56.83,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,什么 \N{\fs50}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.83,0:26:59.08,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我从杰拉德那学到的 一是羡慕他的胡子\N{\fs50}The only thing I got from Gerrard is mustache envy
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.08,0:27:02.78,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,二是练就了刷厕所的绝活\N{\fs50}and a PhD in "scrubbing the crapper."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.33,0:27:05.96,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,听着 他也让你坐过冷板凳 \N{\fs50}Listen, he also benched you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.96,0:27:07.61,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,还有我 \N{\fs50}And me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.61,0:27:09.09,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,让我们闲了那么久\N{\fs50}Kept us out of the action so long
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.09,0:27:12.05,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,久到都忘了自己当初为什么要当消防员 \N{\fs50}we wondered why we signed up in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.05,0:27:14.85,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他让我们削土豆 还把地板擦得锃亮 \N{\fs50}He had us peeling potatoes and spit shining the floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.85,0:27:16.56,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,哈利现在连拖把都没碰过呢 \N{\fs50}Harry hasn't even touched a mop.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.56,0:27:17.93,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,这反而更糟 \N{\fs50}Even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.93,0:27:19.62,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,怎么就更糟了 \N{\fs50}How is that even worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.62,0:27:22.48,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,哈里加入118分队\N{\fs50}Harry signed up for the 118,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.48,0:27:24.98,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,但你却不让他成为团队一员 \N{\fs50}but you won't let him be on the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.98,0:27:26.40,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你知道杰拉德第一次\N{\fs50}Do you know what happened the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.40,0:27:28.11,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,让我进火场时发生了什么吗 \N{\fs50}Gerrard let me on a structure fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.11,0:27:29.90,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 可奇米 - 我失去了我的兄弟 \N{\fs50}- But Chim - I lost a brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.90,0:27:32.23,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,去年 我们又失去了一位朋友 \N{\fs50}Last year, we lost a friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.03,0:27:38.75,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,亨 每次哈里用那种菜鸟一样的\N{\fs50}Hen, every time Harry looks at me with those probie
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.75,0:27:41.64,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,可怜巴巴的眼神看着我 我就忍不住 \N{\fs50}puppy dog eyes, I can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.64,0:27:44.17,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我满脑子都是  巴比的继子\N{\fs50}I just see all the ways that Bobby's stepson
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.17,0:27:47.00,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,雅典娜的儿子 可能会在我的眼皮底下牺牲 \N{\fs50}Athena's son could die on my watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.00,0:27:50.01,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他不仅仅是谁家的孩子 \N{\fs50}He's not just someone's kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.01,0:27:51.97,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,还是别的 \N{\fs50}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.97,0:27:53.65,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你的菜鸟 \N{\fs50}He's your probie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.65,0:27:55.39,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他是你的责任 奇米\N{\fs50}He's your responsibility, Chim.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.39,0:27:57.66,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我知道 所以我才想保护他 \N{\fs50}I know that. That's why I'm trying to protect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.66,0:27:59.64,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,但你不能用泡泡纸把他包起来 \N{\fs50}But you can't protect him in Bubble Wrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.64,0:28:03.44,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他需要历练 因为这工作随时会要了他的命 \N{\fs50}He needs experiences because this job can kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.44,0:28:06.23,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他需要的是一位能教他 带他\N{\fs50}He needs a captain who's gonna show him
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.23,0:28:09.03,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,让他学会如何活下去的队长 \N{\fs50}and teach him how to stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.03,0:28:11.06,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,可如果我做不到呢 \N{\fs50}What if I can't?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.67,0:28:13.67,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,那就放他走 \N{\fs50}Then cut him loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.67,0:28:16.07,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,其他消防站会抢着要他的 \N{\fs50}Some other firehouse will be lucky to have him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.07,0:28:18.62,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他属于118消防队 \N{\fs50}He belongs at the 118.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.62,0:28:21.68,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,那就让他上 教练 \N{\fs50}Then put him in, Coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.04,0:28:30.08,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你坐哪儿 \N{\fs50}Who do you sit next to?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.63,0:28:33.00,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,哪有空位就坐哪儿 \N{\fs50}Whoever is on the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.69,0:28:35.39,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,所以 没有固定座位 \N{\fs50}So, there's no assigned seating?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.39,0:28:37.70,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你坐过公交车吗 \N{\fs50}Have you ridden a bus?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.70,0:28:39.97,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,放松点 伙计 \N{\fs50}Easy, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.97,0:28:42.38,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,把手机收起来 开始吃饭 \N{\fs50}Put your phone away and start eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.06,0:28:46.30,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,现在方便聊聊吗 \N{\fs50}Is now a good time to talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.86,0:28:50.07,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我是不是打扰到你们了 \N{\fs50}I'm interrupting, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.07,0:28:53.70,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,其实 我们刚坐下来准备吃晚饭 \N{\fs50}Actually, we were just sitting down for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.70,0:28:55.71,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你们吃什么 \N{\fs50}What are you having?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.49,0:29:00.20,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,所以 过渡性住房的伙食怎么样 \N{\fs50}So, how's the grub at the transitional house?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.20,0:29:02.08,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,艾丽克斯说那边养了鸡 \N{\fs50}Alex said they have chickens.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.08,0:29:04.58,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,不是拿来吃的 \N{\fs50}Mm. Not to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.73,0:29:09.73,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你多大了 \N{\fs50}How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.73,0:29:11.50,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,十五岁 \N{\fs50}Fifteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.50,0:29:13.73,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你在法庭上说你有个孩子时 \N{\fs50}Hmm. When you said in court you had a kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.73,0:29:15.73,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我还以为他五六岁呢 \N{\fs50}I assumed he was five or six.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.73,0:29:18.05,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我的意思是 你太年轻了 \N{\fs50}I mean, you're so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.05,0:29:20.22,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他倒也没那么年轻 \N{\fs50}He's not that young.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.02,0:29:25.18,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我当爸比较早 \N{\fs50}I got an early start.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.10,0:29:29.11,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你告诉艾丽克斯你要来这里了吗 \N{\fs50}Did you tell Alex that you were gonna be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.11,0:29:31.02,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,需要这么做吗\N{\fs50}Is that how it works?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.02,0:29:33.23,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我去哪儿都得向她报备吗 \N{\fs50}Do I need to tell her everywhere I go?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.23,0:29:35.49,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,谁是艾丽克斯 \N{\fs50}Who's Alex?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.49,0:29:37.32,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,艾丽克斯是\N{\fs50}Alex is
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.32,0:29:39.32,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,帮助阿比盖尔的人 \N{\fs50}helping Abigail.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.32,0:29:41.78,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,她是我在洛杉矶警察局的同事 \N{\fs50}She's a colleague of mine at the LAPD.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.37,0:29:44.15,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,仅此而已 \N{\fs50}Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.76,0:29:47.50,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,什么意思 \N{\fs50}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.50,0:29:49.77,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,没什么 她真的很漂亮 \N{\fs50}I don't know. She's really pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.34,0:29:52.37,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,真的吗 \N{\fs50}She is?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.34,0:29:58.58,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我来收拾这些 \N{\fs50}I'm gonna clear these.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.02,0:30:11.11,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,别 不用你帮忙 好吗 \N{\fs50}Oh, no. Do not help. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.11,0:30:12.27,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我家 我来收拾 \N{\fs50}My house, my mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.27,0:30:15.10,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,做饭和洗碗 \N{\fs50}Dinner and dishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.79,0:30:17.80,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,克里斯托弗真幸运 \N{\fs50}Christopher's lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.95,0:30:20.41,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你简直是个完美的爸爸 \N{\fs50}You're, like, a perfect dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.41,0:30:23.11,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我还差得远 \N{\fs50}Oh, I'm far from perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.80,0:30:27.21,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我都不送我儿子上学了 \N{\fs50}I don't even drive my son to school anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.29,0:30:30.96,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,克里斯坐公交车 \N{\fs50}Chris takes the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.96,0:30:34.34,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他嘴上说想要自由 可其实 \N{\fs50}Says he wants freedom, but really,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.34,0:30:36.34,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,是我太忙了 连轴转上二十四小时班 \N{\fs50}I'm too busy just working 24-hour shifts
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.34,0:30:39.38,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,连放学接他都抽不出时间 \N{\fs50}to show my face at pickup.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.19,0:30:51.43,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我父母被无罪释放了 \N{\fs50}My parents got acquitted.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.23,0:30:54.44,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,什么 \N{\fs50}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.44,0:30:56.32,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,所有指控都不成立 \N{\fs50}On all charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.32,0:30:57.84,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,地方检察官打的电话 \N{\fs50}The D.A. called.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.82,0:31:01.84,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,这怎么可能 \N{\fs50}How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.82,0:31:05.58,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,有辆教会的车\N{\fs50}All I know is a ministry van
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.58,0:31:08.20,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,去监狱把他们接走了 \N{\fs50}came and picked them up from the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.08,0:31:11.85,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他们能回到以前的生活 \N{\fs50}They get to go back to their old lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.54,0:31:15.62,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,而我却什么都没有 \N{\fs50}I get nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.84,0:31:22.25,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我真的很抱歉 阿比盖尔 \N{\fs50}I am so sorry, Abigail.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.44,0:31:39.88,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,时间不早了 \N{\fs50}Uh, it's-it's getting pretty late,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.07,0:31:42.53,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,而且开车回帕萨迪纳要很久 \N{\fs50}and it's a long drive back to Pasadena.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.53,0:31:43.87,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,或许\N{\fs50}Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.87,0:31:46.90,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,要是不打扰的话 \N{\fs50}Only if I'm not imposing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.89,0:31:50.25,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,抱歉 你说什么 \N{\fs50}Uh, I'm sorry, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.25,0:31:52.25,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,哦 我 \N{\fs50}Oh, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.25,0:31:54.25,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我以为你在邀请我留宿 \N{\fs50}I thought you were inviting me to stay the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.25,0:31:56.59,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 不 - 睡沙发就行 \N{\fs50}- No. - On the couch, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.59,0:31:58.25,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我是说 你开车回去没问题吧 \N{\fs50}I meant, are you okay to drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.90,0:32:01.47,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,当然 \N{\fs50}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.47,0:32:02.84,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,没问题 \N{\fs50}U-Uh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.84,0:32:04.64,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,不打扰你们了 \N{\fs50}I'll leave you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.64,0:32:07.39,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,对不起 我太蠢了 \N{\fs50}I'm so sorry. I'm so dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.39,0:32:09.02,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 但 - 没关系 阿比盖尔 \N{\fs50}- But - It's fine. Abigail.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.02,0:32:10.27,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你不蠢 \N{\fs50}You're not dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.27,0:32:12.48,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,而且你不是一个人 好吗 \N{\fs50}And you're not alone, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.48,0:32:15.18,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 记住了吗 - 好 \N{\fs50}- Remember that? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.93,0:32:29.93,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,哈里 \N{\fs50}Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.93,0:32:34.46,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,巴克说只要我不碰刀 就没事 \N{\fs50}Buck said it was okay as long as I don't touch the knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.46,0:32:36.74,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,过来 跟你说句话 \N{\fs50}Yeah. A word.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.94,0:32:41.12,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,去吧 这里我来收拾就好 \N{\fs50}Go. I'll finish up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.30,0:32:49.95,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,坐吧 \N{\fs50}Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.95,0:32:55.95,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你知道我也曾是这个消防站的菜鸟队员 对吧 \N{\fs50}So, you know I was a probie in this firehouse, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.95,0:32:57.96,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,在二十年前 \N{\fs50}20 years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.15,0:33:01.57,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我在这里的第一年 \N{\fs50}My first year here,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.57,0:33:03.96,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,是我职业生涯中最糟糕的一年 \N{\fs50}that was the worst year of my career.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.96,0:33:05.57,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,也许是我人生中最糟糕的一年 \N{\fs50}Maybe my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.57,0:33:09.03,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,队长 我不知道自己哪里做错了\N{\fs50}Look, Cap, I don't know what I did wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.03,0:33:10.83,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,但你告诉我 我马上改 \N{\fs50}but if you tell me, I can fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.83,0:33:13.70,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你没做错任何事 哈里 实际上 \N{\fs50}You haven't done anything wrong, Harry. In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.70,0:33:15.71,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你几乎什么都没做 这是我的问题 \N{\fs50}you haven't really done much of anything, which is my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.71,0:33:18.92,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我当菜鸟的时候 \N{\fs50}You see, when I was a probie,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.92,0:33:22.55,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,有一阵子 我的队长就只让我收拾桌子 \N{\fs50}for a while, all my cap let me do was clear tables.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.55,0:33:24.38,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,像个高级服务员 \N{\fs50}I was like a glorified busboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.38,0:33:27.25,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,真的很难不往心里去 \N{\fs50}It was really hard not to take that personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.99,0:33:30.00,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我想说的是 \N{\fs50}What I'm saying is...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.64,0:33:32.85,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,问题不在你 孩子 在我 \N{\fs50}...you're not the problem, kid. I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.85,0:33:35.18,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我当年很幸运 这里有个人\N{\fs50}You see, I was lucky enough that there was someone
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.18,0:33:38.00,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,愿意给我一个机会 \N{\fs50}here who gave me a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.00,0:33:40.40,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你现在也需要一个人\N{\fs50}What you need is someone
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.40,0:33:42.53,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,该死 \N{\fs50}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.53,0:33:44.44,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,没事的 你回来再跟我说就好\N{\fs50}It's okay. You can tell me when you get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.44,0:33:49.24,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你需要的是有人愿意给你一个机会 \N{\fs50}What you need is someone to take a chance on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.24,0:33:50.98,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,来吧 哈里 \N{\fs50}Come on, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.99,0:33:53.24,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,真的吗 \N{\fs50}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.24,0:33:55.32,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,在我改变主意之前 快上车 \N{\fs50}Get in the rig before I change my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.01,0:33:57.67,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,走吧 菜鸟 \N{\fs50}Let's go, rookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.67,0:34:00.99,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,快点 菜鸟 \N{\fs50}Hurry up, probie.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.79,0:34:20.16,置顶,,0,0,0,,洛杉矶消防局云梯消防车
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.57,0:34:24.98,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,那辆着火的是你的垃圾车吗 \N{\fs50}That your garbage truck on fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.98,0:34:27.57,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,是的 我本想卸货 但液压系统卡住了 \N{\fs50}Yeah. I tried to empty my load, but my hydraulics seized.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.57,0:34:29.61,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,垃圾就烧起来了 这东西冒烟\N{\fs50}The garbage is on fire. How long has this thing
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.61,0:34:31.62,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 多久了 - 大概是\N{\fs50}- been smoking? - I think I noticed it
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.62,0:34:33.41,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 二十分钟前发现的 - 二十分钟分钟 收到 \N{\fs50}- like 20 minutes ago. - 20 minutes. Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.41,0:34:35.58,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,队长 它在呼吸 \N{\fs50}Hey, Cap, it's breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.58,0:34:38.79,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,一旦接触到空气 就会\N{\fs50}When this fire finally gets some air, it's gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.79,0:34:41.08,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 回燃 - 我们可以切开货厢 \N{\fs50}- Back draft. - We can cut the pits,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.08,0:34:42.75,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,打开挡板 \N{\fs50}open the tailgate
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.75,0:34:44.34,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,把着火的垃圾全倒到街上 \N{\fs50}and dump all the burning trash into the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.34,0:34:46.06,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,不行 它烧得太久了 \N{\fs50}No, it's been burning too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.06,0:34:48.07,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,现在让它接触氧气 会直接变成炸弹 \N{\fs50}We introduce oxygen right now, that trash turns into a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.07,0:34:49.43,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,那隔绝氧气灭火 \N{\fs50}How about we starve it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.43,0:34:50.64,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,如果我们想把卡车\N{\fs50}If we want to lose the truck
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.64,0:34:52.05,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,和整条街都赔进去 就这么干 \N{\fs50}and the whole block, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.05,0:34:55.06,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我在消防学院的最后一周见过这种情况 \N{\fs50}Look, I saw this in my last week at the academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.06,0:34:56.07,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,火要是烧得够猛 \N{\fs50}If that fire burns hot enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.27,0:34:57.64,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,就会烧到油箱 \N{\fs50}it's gonna reach the diesel tanks,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.64,0:34:59.02,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,甚至是液压管 \N{\fs50}maybe even the hydraulic lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.02,0:35:00.90,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,是啊 看哪个先到 \N{\fs50}Yeah, or whichever one comes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.90,0:35:02.40,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,然后 砰 \N{\fs50}And then boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.40,0:35:04.08,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,好了 疏散所有人 \N{\fs50}All right, let's clear everyone out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.08,0:35:05.65,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,设置一百英尺的警戒区 \N{\fs50}I want a 100-foot perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.65,0:35:07.77,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,收到 路锥马上到 \N{\fs50}Copy that. Cones on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.24,0:35:11.82,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,好 上一点五英寸的水带 \N{\fs50}All right, fire up a one and three-quarter inch line
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.82,0:35:13.20,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,配上穿刺喷头 \N{\fs50}with a piercing nozzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.20,0:35:14.45,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,对垃圾进行间接攻击\N{\fs50}I want an indirect attack on that trash
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.45,0:35:16.08,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,先把内部温度降下来\N{\fs50}to cool things down in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.08,0:35:17.45,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 行动 - 收到 队长\N{\fs50}- Let's move! - Copy you, Cap.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.45,0:35:18.79,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 马上来 - 嘿 \N{\fs50}- On it! - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.79,0:35:20.10,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,哈里 \N{\fs50}Hey, Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.10,0:35:21.83,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 哈里 - 安全第一\N{\fs50}- Harry! - Safety first.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.83,0:35:23.45,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,对吧 队长 \N{\fs50}Right, Cap?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.79,0:35:27.08,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,对 安全第一\N{\fs50}Right. Safety first.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.11,0:35:30.11,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我们准备好了\N{\fs50}We're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.80,0:35:33.42,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,好的 收到\N{\fs50}All right, copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.52,0:35:42.65,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 队长 就位了 - 准备好了\N{\fs50}- Yeah, Cap, we're in. - Ready here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.65,0:35:45.31,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,打开红色水带\N{\fs50}All right, open the red line.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.65,0:35:51.32,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,巴克 情况如何 \N{\fs50}Buck, how we looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.32,0:35:54.13,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,快好了\N{\fs50}Yeah, almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.37,0:35:59.83,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,队长 已经好了\N{\fs50}Okay, Cap, we got conversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.83,0:36:01.08,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,拔掉插销 打开挡板\N{\fs50}Let's cut the pin. Pop the tailgate.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.08,0:36:03.37,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,换两英寸半的水带灭火\N{\fs50}I want a two and a half inch on that trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.37,0:36:06.54,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,哈里 把垃圾钩给我\N{\fs50}Harry, get me those rubbish hooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.09,0:36:08.15,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,哈里 \N{\fs50}Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.38,0:36:10.15,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,哈里 \N{\fs50}Harry?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.15,0:36:12.15,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,帕尼卡 把钩子给我 \N{\fs50}Panikkar, grab me the hooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.38,0:36:14.15,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你能搞定吗 \N{\fs50}You good on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.34,0:36:16.15,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 快 - 交给我们 队长 \N{\fs50}- Go! - We got it, Cap.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.15,0:36:17.39,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,哈里 \N{\fs50}Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.39,0:36:19.02,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,等等 别开车 \N{\fs50}Wait. Don't drive!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.02,0:36:20.81,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,哈里 \N{\fs50}Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.81,0:36:23.10,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,所有人停车 \N{\fs50}Everybody, stop driving!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.10,0:36:25.30,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,哈里 \N{\fs50}Harry?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.15,0:36:28.52,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,哈里 \N{\fs50}Harry?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.32,0:36:31.24,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,哈里 \N{\fs50}Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.24,0:36:32.74,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,哈里 该死 \N{\fs50}Harry? Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.74,0:36:34.17,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,停车 \N{\fs50}Stop driving!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.17,0:36:36.19,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,所有人停车\N{\fs50}Everybody, stop driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.87,0:36:42.96,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,队长 你还好吗 \N{\fs50}Hey, Cap, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.96,0:36:44.46,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,嗯 \N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.18,0:36:48.79,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,巴克 埃迪 去看看司机 \N{\fs50}Buck, Eddie, check the driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.38,0:36:51.83,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,好 来吧 \N{\fs50}Okay. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.20,0:36:59.56,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你去哪了 \N{\fs50}Where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.56,0:37:02.22,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我在外围 拦着那些人 \N{\fs50}I was at the perimeter. I was holding those people back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.73,0:37:05.76,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你真没事吧 队长 \N{\fs50}You sure you're okay, Cap?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.98,0:37:10.98,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,嗯 \N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.98,0:37:14.21,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,疑似轻微中风 无明显外伤 \N{\fs50}Possible minor stroke. Doesn't appear to be injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.40,0:37:16.61,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我和他半斤八两 \N{\fs50}That makes two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.61,0:37:18.22,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,干得好 菜鸟 \N{\fs50}Good job, probie.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.22,0:37:20.53,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,谢谢 队长 \N{\fs50}Thanks, Cap.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.53,0:37:22.75,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我需要你回去 \N{\fs50}All right, I need you guys back!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.75,0:37:25.66,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,各位干得漂亮\N{\fs50}Good job, everyone. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.98,0:37:50.25,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,格兰特 你要去哪儿 \N{\fs50}Grant. You going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.25,0:37:52.25,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我想去拿点零食吃 \N{\fs50}Yeah, I was just gonna grab a snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.44,0:37:55.89,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你觉得现在是吃零食的时候吗 菜鸟 \N{\fs50}You think snacking is a good use of your time, probie?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.99,0:37:58.86,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,去把厕所刷了 \N{\fs50}Go scrub the crapper.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.62,0:38:02.26,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,是的 长官\N{\fs50}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.25,0:38:06.95,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,欢迎加入118分队 小子 \N{\fs50}And welcome to the 118, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.17,0:38:10.83,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,谢谢 \N{\fs50}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.84,0:38:13.55,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,把厕所刷了 \N{\fs50}Scrub that crapper!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.34,0:38:20.55,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,嘿 \N{\fs50}{\i1}Hey.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.55,0:38:22.05,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你那边怎么样了 \N{\fs50}How's it going over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.05,0:38:25.39,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,最后一个  弄完我就走\N{\fs50}Uh, last one, and then I will get out of your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.39,0:38:27.31,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,好了 \N{\fs50}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.27,0:38:31.98,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 你们俩玩得开心 - 好啊 \N{\fs50}- Ah. Have fun, you two. - Ah, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.98,0:38:34.94,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,那肯定的 \N{\fs50}Oh, we will. We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.94,0:38:37.45,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,嗷呜 霸王龙老爸\N{\fs50}Grr! Dadasaurus Rex
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.45,0:38:40.30,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,出没啦\N{\fs50}is on the loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.00,0:38:49.12,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,恐龙防护罩 今天过得怎么样 \N{\fs50}Dino-proof. Ah! How was your day?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.12,0:38:51.67,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,挺好的 不过感觉你们过得更开心 \N{\fs50}Uh, it was good, but I think yours might have been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.67,0:38:53.38,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 值班很顺利 \N{\fs50}- Hi. - Well, shift went well,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.38,0:38:55.34,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,还陪这两个小家伙搭了个堡垒 \N{\fs50}plus, I got to build a fort with these two.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.34,0:38:57.71,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,还有比这更美的事吗 \N{\fs50}Who can ask for more than that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.59,0:39:00.93,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,咱们晚饭前把这里收拾一下 \N{\fs50}Let's clean this up before dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.93,0:39:02.64,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,才不要 \N{\fs50}Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.64,0:39:04.32,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,所以 哈里还好吗 \N{\fs50}So, Harry was all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.56,0:39:06.32,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,何止是好 \N{\fs50}More than all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.32,0:39:08.33,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,这孩子虽说年纪小\N{\fs50}You know, the kid is young,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.33,0:39:10.33,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,但我觉得他天生就是干这行的料 \N{\fs50}but I think he has what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.56,0:39:12.33,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,这么说 你再也不会做噩梦了 \N{\fs50}So, no more nightmares?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.33,0:39:15.07,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,而且他还救了我一命 \N{\fs50}Uh-huh. Plus, he saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.07,0:39:18.11,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,等等 你差点出事 奇米\N{\fs50}Wait, your life was in danger? Chimney?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.11,0:39:19.74,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,看看你 你开窍了 \N{\fs50}Look at you. You're getting it. -
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.74,0:39:22.34,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你开窍了\N{\fs50}You're getting it. Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.34,0:39:24.87,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,妈 放开我 我自己来 \N{\fs50}Mom, let me go. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.87,0:39:26.66,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,超级里德登场 \N{\fs50}It's SuperReid!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.66,0:39:28.35,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你绝对想不到\N{\fs50}{\i1}You wouldn't believe{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.35,0:39:30.35,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我擦完之后那玩意有多亮 \N{\fs50}the shine on that thing when I was done.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.58,0:39:34.00,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,没想到你当消防员的第一周\N{\fs50}Wow. I mean, I wasn't expecting your first week as a firefighter
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.00,0:39:35.88,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,会用到这么多清洁剂 \N{\fs50}to involve so many cleaning products.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.09,0:39:38.76,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,梅 这是菜鸟的日常 \N{\fs50}That's the life of a probie, May.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.76,0:39:40.36,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,虽说不怎么光鲜 但都很重要 \N{\fs50}It's not all glamorous, but it's all important.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.59,0:39:42.01,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,说实话\N{\fs50}Personally,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.01,0:39:43.89,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,很庆幸 今天早上 \N{\fs50}I appreciate that I learned three new uses
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.89,0:39:47.14,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,- 学到了白醋的三个新用法 - 不是吧\N{\fs50}- for white vinegar this morning. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.14,0:39:49.68,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,这才哪到哪 你们现在笑吧 \N{\fs50}You know what? It's all good. You laugh now,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.68,0:39:52.06,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,等我把洗碗机里面擦得锃亮\N{\fs50}but just you wait until I make the interior
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.06,0:39:53.60,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你们就知道厉害了 \N{\fs50}of that dishwasher shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.60,0:39:55.06,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,先别急\N{\fs50}Mm. Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.06,0:39:58.68,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我们有东西要给你 \N{\fs50}We have something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.49,0:40:00.65,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,本来想在你第一天上班前\N{\fs50}We wanted to give this to you
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.65,0:40:01.65,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,就给你的\N{\fs50}before your first day,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.65,0:40:03.61,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,结果你没给我们机会 \N{\fs50}but you didn't give us a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.55,0:40:24.39,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,巴比的刀 \N{\fs50}Bobby's knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.85,0:40:27.39,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我们希望你在身上带着点\N{\fs50}We wanted you to have a little piece
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.39,0:40:29.67,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他的东西 \N{\fs50}of him to carry with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.42,0:40:42.82,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们\N{\fs50}Thank you, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.82,0:40:44.42,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,我很喜欢 \N{\fs50}I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.42,0:40:47.48,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他会为你感到骄傲的 哈里 \N{\fs50}He would've been so proud of you, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.08,0:40:51.20,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,那另一个盒子里是什么 毕竟 \N{\fs50}So, what's in the other box? I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.20,0:40:53.66,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,第一个礼物已经很难超越了 \N{\fs50}first one's kind of a hard act to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.66,0:40:58.08,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,要是巴比还在 也一定会送给你的 \N{\fs50}Well, this is what Bobby would have given you, if he were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.80,0:41:07.79,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他会希望你有一把自己的刀 \N{\fs50}He'd want you to have your own knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.76,0:41:11.47,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,活成独当一面的自己 \N{\fs50}And let you be your own man.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.74,0:41:28.47,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,真希望他在这里 \N{\fs50}I wish he were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.47,0:41:32.24,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,他一直都在 \N{\fs50}He is.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.84,0:41:47.29,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,克里斯托弗 \N{\fs50}Christopher.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.05,0:41:50.05,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,阿比盖尔 \N{\fs50}Abigail?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.05,0:41:51.68,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你怎么会在这里 \N{\fs50}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.68,0:41:53.10,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,你爸爸上班忙 \N{\fs50}Your dad's busy at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.10,0:41:55.47,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,让我来接你 \N{\fs50}He asked me to come get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.10,0:41:57.89,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,好的 \N{\fs50}Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.50,0:42:00.76,字幕样式,,0,0,0,,走吧 我的车就在那边\N{\fs50}Okay. My car's just over there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.52,0:42:26.02,置顶,,0,0,0,,冬奥停播 下集将于2月26日回归
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
